note: Hello from Entron!
note: A short demonstration of variables, output, and loops.

define variable greeting as "Hello from Entron!"
display greeting

note: Count loop — print numbers 1 through 5
count from 1 to 5 as i do
    display "Count: " joined with i
end count

note: Repeat loop — repeat a fixed number of times
repeat 3 times
    display "Entron is working."
end repeat

note: For each loop — iterate over a list
define variable languages as list containing "Entron" and "Python" and "JavaScript"
for each lang in languages do
    display "Language: " joined with lang
end for

note: String interpolation
define variable version as 1
display "Entron v{{ version }} — plain English programming!"
